s at native-image runtime:\n```\norg.springframework.cglib.core.CodeGenerationException: com.oracle.svm.core.jdk.UnsupportedFeatureError-->\nClasses cannot be defined at runtime by default when using ahead-of-time Native Image compilation.\nTried to define class: org/springframework/transaction/aspectj/AspectJTransactionManagementConfiguration$$SpringCGLIB$$0\n```\nand the same for `org/springframework/context/annotation/aspectj/SpringConfiguredConfiguration$$SpringCGLIB$$0`.\n\nThis is Spring 6's `ConfigurationClassPostProcessor` CGLIB-enhancing its own internal config classes (imported via `@EnableTransactionManagement`/`@EnableSpringConfigured`), unrelated to the user's own `@Configuration(proxyBeanMethods = false)` test classes.\n\n**This is not an unsupportable mechanism** — this repo already has a proven, working pattern for exactly this CGLIB-proxy-at-build-time problem (`PredefinedCglibProxyClassesGenerator` used in `org.springframework/spring-context/6.0.0`, `spring-aop/6.0.0`, `spring-shell-core-autoconfigure/4.0.2`, `spring-cloud-function-context/5.0.x`): a JavaExec task runs the code path in a plain JVM before `nativeTestCompile`, dumping the exact `...$$SpringCGLIB$$N.class` bytes into the test classes dir so they're ordinary compiled classes by the time native-image builds, plus reflection metadata (`condition.typeReached: org.springframework.cglib.proxy.Enhancer`) and the `spring.objenesis.ignore=true` system property (test + native runtime arg). A viable fallback exists, so per the grounding rules this is repairable, not `skip_unsupported`.\n\n## Decision\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"advisory_preparation\",\n  \"summary\": \"spring-aspects 6.0.0 CGLIB-enhances Spring's internal @EnableTransactionManagement/@EnableSpringConfigured configuration classes (AspectJTransactionManagementConfiguration, SpringConfiguredConfiguration), which fails native-image with 'Classes cannot be defined at runtime'; this repo already has a working predefined-CGLIB-class workaround for the same pattern in spring-context/spring-aop 6.0.0, so it needs porting rather than new dependencies.\",\n  \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n  \"agent_guidance\": \"Reproduce first with `env GVM_TCK_LV=6.0.0 GVM_TCK_NATIVE_IMAGE_MODE=current-defaults ./gradlew clean test -Pcoordinates=org.springframework:spring-aspects:5.3.31` to confirm the exact failing proxy class names before generating metadata. Mirror the pattern already used in tests/src/org.springframework/spring-context/6.0.0 and tests/src/org.springframework/spring-aop/6.0.0: add a PredefinedCglibProxyClassesGenerator (JavaExec) that exercises the code paths creating AspectJTransactionManagementConfiguration$$SpringCGLIB$$0 and SpringConfiguredConfiguration$$SpringCGLIB$$0 (via aspectjModeRegistersCacheTransactionAndAsyncInfrastructureAspects()/springConfiguredRegistersTheSingletonBeanConfigurerAspect()-style setup), dumping .class bytes into the test classes dir via the cglib.debugLocation system property; wire a generatePredefinedCglibProxyClasses task that nativeTestCompile/nativeTraceImage depend on. Set spring.objenesis.ignore=true as a systemProperty on Test tasks and as a nativeTest runtimeArgs / graalvmNative.binaries.test buildArgs entry. Register the generated proxy classes in reachability-metadata.json as reflection entries with condition.typeReached = org.springframework.cglib.proxy.Enhancer, following the exact structure in spring-context/6.0.0's reachability-metadata.json.\",\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"The exact CGLIB proxy class names/count depend on which internal @Configuration classes get enhanced for spring-aspects' AnnotationTransactionAspect/AnnotationCacheAspect/AnnotationAsyncExecutionAspect/AnnotationBeanConfigurerAspect wiring; must be verified locally via reproduction rather than assumed from the spring-context precedent.\",\n    \"Only 2 of 8 tests failed in this reproduction; other tests may reveal further CGLIB proxy classes once the metadata/test suite is regenerated against 6.0.0 rather than reused from 5.3.31.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":7683,"type":"result","duration_ms":307657,"uuid":"2d8bf78b-6f3c-4c17-9d44-db05cfd7160c","ttft_stream_ms":1245,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":1245,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

